iler":false,"text":"With no children from the marriage, she experiences deep loneliness and seeks solace through an app, somewhat recklessly looking for companionship and healing."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133491"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し暗く、どこか自信なさげな様子を見せる元人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は、明るく、誰にでも優しく、だけど慎ましさを持つ大和撫子のような性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高校卒業後、上京して就職した会社の上司と結婚するも、夫の浮気により破綻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供もいなかった事で、お金を渡されてあっさりと捨てられてしまい、そのせいで色々と自信を失い、現在に至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体と心の寂しさを癒そうと、半ば自暴自棄気味にアプリに手を出す事に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し暗く、どこか自信なさげな様子を見せる元人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は、明るく、誰にでも優しく、だけど慎ましさを持つ大和撫子のような性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高校卒業後、上京して就職した会社の上司と結婚するも、夫の浮気により破綻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供もいなかった事で、お金を渡されてあっさりと捨てられてしまい、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいで色々と自信を失い、現在に至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体と心の寂しさを癒そうと、半ば自暴自棄気味にアプリに手を出す事に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キョウコ編は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の妻になっていた幼馴染みのお姉さんとの、やり直しラブストーリー。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149136"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"100 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"i","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"65 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26607","sourceWorkId":"35644","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"ht